layers.diagram:
flowchart TD
  G[Graph problem] --> W{Weighted?}
  W -->|No, shortest hops| B[BFS with queue]
  W -->|Yes| D[Dijkstra with heap]
  G --> R{Structure or reachability?}
  R -->|Yes| F[DFS with recursion/stack]
  G --> P{Prefix matching?}
  P -->|Yes| T[Trie]

flowchart TD
  P[New problem] --> A{Polynomial algorithm known?}
  A -->|Yes| E[Use it]
  A -->|No| R[Reduce from a known NP-complete problem]
  R --> H{Hard?}
  H -->|No| E
  H -->|Yes| S{Instance size?}
  S -->|Small| X[Exact: DP / branch and bound]
  S -->|Large| Y[Approximation with ratio]
  Y --> Z[Measure and document quality]

flowchart TD
  D[Dataset] --> T{Supervised?}
  T -->|Yes| E{Error profile?}
  E -->|High variance| B[Bagging / random forest]
  E -->|High bias| G[Boosting]
  T -->|No| U{Goal?}
  U -->|Grouping| K[k-means / DBSCAN]
  U -->|Compression| P[PCA / t-SNE]
